{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat your opponents at the card table and uncover their secrets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TCA is a political, humorous card adventure game with charm. Discover the atmospheric (ballpoint pen) hand-drawn world and its inhabitants and collect lots of cards in the process! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084870/extras/4932772a2f0e457cb4749bd8edc35c3e.poster.avif?t=1760101336\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084870/extras/4932772a2f0e457cb4749bd8edc35c3e.webm?t=1760101336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect cards and build a deck!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084870/extras/85c151b14e0eecbf3c59eb2dc49eb154.avif?t=1760101336\" width=840 height=473 /></span>Choose from many cards with different values and abilities to build your own deck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talk to characters and learn dark truths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084870/extras/e568269e11f7106e9626e7c7d3cb35c4.avif?t=1760101336\" width=840 height=473 /></span>What lies behind the fa\u00e7ade of the cozy small town? A demonic rat, a cult in the sewers and the impending end of the world. In between, the everyday madness of the present. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your very own strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084870/extras/85c81e289186cf148a91b7d4ca3c6dc1.avif?t=1760101336\" width=840